    /// <summary>Recomputes one section of the shared conformance vectors: the section's name and a JSON document in its shape go in, and the same document comes out with every outcome computed again by the parsers and encoders the server uses, as canonical JSON. The entry keeps no state and never panics on arbitrary bytes.</summary>
